<title>ITALY: Stet sees 3 trln lire 1996 cons net profiT.</title>
<headline>Stet sees 3 trln lire 1996 cons net profiT.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian telecommunications holding Stet said on Friday it forecast 1996 consolidated net profit of 3.0 trillion lire against 2.452 trillion in 1995.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it saw consolidated sales of more than 40 trillion lire, a rise of eight percent on the previous year and a reduction of about three trillion lire in net debt.</p>
</text>
